 & =\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-108630/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9d7a21aa-f2e3-5461-81a6-5cbd0f63c03d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-108630"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-39255/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "058ac5e9-a3b0-57a7-9947-8f75c5860bc7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39255/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "6fc51035-39d3-5111-a061-73661262e858" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39255/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "9677e06b-492e-5e23-ba7e-a8dc19178635" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39255/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "c45afdd0-3c31-5583-918b-e9b31d57cc5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39255/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "d83d2b50-1044-5487-8647-771564f12f5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39255/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc370fae-9bad-56e2-86de-bce6a23c2576" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-39255/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer-field/choices ["q-39255/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" "q-39255/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" "q-39255/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-39255/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" "q-39255/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-39255" :question/id #uuid "93078165-4628-5085-9eb3-223554735697" :question/math-academy-id "q-39255" :question/problem "If the sum of the first $18$ terms of an arithmetic series is ${S}_{18}=-495,$ and the last term is ${a}_{18}=-62,$ what is the first term of the series?" :question/worked-solution "We are given the last term of our series. So, to find the first term, we use the formula for the sum of an arithmetic series in the form\n\n$$\n{S}_{N}=\\frac{N}{2}({a}_{1}+{a}_{N}),\n$$\n\nwhere ${a}_{1}$ is the first term, ${a}_{N}$ is the last term, and $N$ is the number of terms.\n\nSubstituting ${a}_{18}=-62$, $N=18$, and ${S}_{N}=-495$ into the formula above and solving for ${a}_{1}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-495 & =\\frac{18}{2}({a}_{1}-62) \\\\ -495 & =9({a}_{1}-62) \\\\ \\frac{-495}{9} & ={a}_{1}-62 \\\\ -55 & ={a}_{1}-62 \\\\ {a}_{1} & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-39255/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9d7a21aa-f2e3-5461-81a6-5cbd0f63c03d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-39255"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-5606/selection/12b7d840a997b0af25896f37c76d366155c72a970c1525c62ec119b69786f393" :answer/id #uuid "cdc4492d-3a6e-52bd-b687-cc15fc952020" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-5606/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "4341e96a-7131-5460-a29b-3e611b827de5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-5606/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "0563f152-9438-5b48-be28-77ee44